<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD CLOSE OF PLAY SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD CLOSE OF PLAY SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the first</p>
<p>day of four-day Sheffield Shield cricket matches on Thursday.</p>
<p>In Brisbane: Queensland 179; Western Australia 102 for four.</p>
<p>In Melbourne: New South Wales 290 (Michael Slater 71);</p>
<p>Victoria 12 for one.</p>
</text>
